    {
      "id": "c25ca064d1",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h1",
      "text": "Can you track Google Meet attendance on iPad &amp; mobile?"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c566fabb",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "As more teachers and managers use iPads, Chromebooks, and mobile devices for remote meetings, a common question arises: can you take attendance in Google Meet on mobile devices? Here is how it works and how to set up cross-device tracking."
    },
    {
      "id": "37a4fcb824",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "div",
      "text": "<strong>How Mobile Tracking Works:</strong> While mobile Google Meet native apps don't support side-panel add-ons, the <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/marketplace/app/attendance_tracker/829771833968?utm_source=seo_mobile\">Attendance Tracker backend</a> automatically records all attendees (including mobile and phone dial-in participants) and lets you review history from your mobile browser or PWA."
    },
    {
      "id": "8edf7b2b6c",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "1. Are Mobile Attendees Captured in Google Meet?"
    },
    {
      "id": "8dfa17ab6f",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "<strong>Yes.</strong> When you run Attendance Tracker in your meeting, it uses the official Google Meet REST API. This means it accurately records:"
    },
    {
      "id": "b40f4a5e97",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Students and colleagues joining from iPads, iPhones, and Android devices"
    },
    {
      "id": "2dd0aa29b0",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Users joining from the Google Meet mobile app or Safari/Chrome mobile browser"
    },
    {
      "id": "95d9f0e48a",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Phone dial-in participants (with masked caller numbers)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3981eff96",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Chromebook and laptop users"
    },
    {
      "id": "834dfc9271",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "2. Viewing Attendance History on iPad &amp; Mobile (PWA)"
    },
    {
      "id": "afafd1cf15",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Attendance Tracker includes a fully responsive <strong>Progressive Web App (PWA)</strong> dashboard:"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b7b5f298b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Install to Home Screen:</strong> Open <a href=\"https://attendancetracker.dev/history.html\">attendancetracker.dev/history.html</a> in Safari on iOS or Chrome on Android and tap <em>Add to Home Screen</em>."
    },
    {
      "id": "dbdfb57c02",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Touch-Optimized Interface:</strong> Review past meeting attendance rosters, student attendance percentages, and series streaks directly from your tablet."
    },
    {
      "id": "c11eedc0f2",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>One-Tap Google Sheets Access:</strong> Open auto-generated spreadsheets directly in the Google Sheets mobile app on iPad or iPhone."
    },
    {
      "id": "bcaf09a42a",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "3. Exporting Attendance While on the Go"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec80031542",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Because Attendance Tracker synchronizes directly with your Google Drive in the cloud, you don't need a laptop to access your data:"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e130707f2",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Meeting ends and attendance is auto-saved to your Google Drive folder <code>Meet Attendance Tracker</code>."
    },
    {
      "id": "349a691608",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "An instant summary email lands in your Gmail inbox on mobile."
    },
    {
      "id": "16110511e1",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "If Slack is connected, a formatted digest card posts immediately to your team's Slack mobile app."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb27e1867a",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h3",
      "text": "Start tracking attendance across all devices"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd8d509aff",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Free, works seamlessly with Google Drive, Gmail, and mobile sheets."
    },
    {
      "id": "14b133eb0f",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "a",
      "text": "Install Attendance Tracker from Marketplace"
    },
